# Cloudflare Pages response headers for the admin site (copied into dist/ by the build).
# The script policy matters most: with ADMIN_LOGIN=firebase the sign-in lives in browser storage that any script
# on the page can read, so only the site's own files and Google's sign-in script (loaded by Firebase Auth) may run.
# Styles, images, audio and API calls are not restricted here: the API and clip addresses differ per deployment.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: script-src 'self' https://apis.google.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
